[Main]
Choice
Name=TACheckRev
Title=EA Торг. контроль
Group=ТА

[Output]
work=c

[Code]
<lines>
  taCur.Advise();
  if (taCur.stop)
  {
    OrderForceClose(hid);
    taCur.Release();
    hub_state = HUB_CLOSED;
    hub_activated = true;
  }
  else
  {
      if (hid>=0 && norm(taCur.tp)!=hub[hid].ftp)
        OrderSetTP(hid, norm(taCur.tp));
      if (hid>=0 && norm(taCur.sl)!=hub[hid].fsl)
        OrderSetSL(hid, norm(taCur.sl));
$work.lines
  }

[Help]
Обработка закрытий и коррект. уровней.
